Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 19:53:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 89/91] Killmails list every attacker

Ships, starbase structures and customs offices now remember who damaged
them in the last 15 minutes. The killmail lists everyone involved with
their ship, the weapon they did most damage with, their damage and
their security status, using the attackers block the client reads from
killBlob. Drones count for their pilot. The final blow gets the real
security status and total damage, and Damage Taken is the sum of all
of it instead of the ship's total HP.

An NPC's final blow is sent as no character, so the client shows it as
"type / owner" the way it does for NPC attackers. Missiles show the
missile rather than the launcher.
